              <div style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:17px; letter-spacing:-0.01em;">Verifiable privacy</div>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#9AA0C3; margin:10px 0 0;">No analytics, no tracking cookies, no third-party fonts, and published answers show aliases instead of Discord names. Check any of it yourself.</p>
