              <div style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:17px; letter-spacing:-0.01em;">Host it yourself</div>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#9AA0C3; margin:10px 0 0;">One <span style="color:#C4B5FD; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:13px;">docker compose up</span> runs the whole stack on your own server, with every feature unlocked and no licence key.</p>
            </div>
            <div style="background:rgba(27,29,51,0.55); border:1px solid rgba(244,245,255,0.1); border-radius:18px; padding:24px;">
              <div style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:17px; letter-spacing:-0.01em;">No lock-in</div>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#9AA0C3; margin:10px 0 0;">Embeddings can run locally on CPU, for free. Turn the AI off entirely and Dejavue still does duplicate detection, search and the archive.</p>
